  "rule": "one stretch per instrument, the same for every year of that instrument: percentiles [0.5, 99.5] of all in-box pixels of its scenes. ETM+ pan (0.52-0.90 um) includes near-infrared where sand is brighter than in OLI/OLI-2 pan (0.50-0.68 um), so ETM+ vs OLI brightness differences are partly instrumental. Projected frames use the stretch of the latest scene's instrument."
